#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:1 c8444a7049d24f86aecc9fe7cc631205
msgid "QuaNThoR quickstart"
msgstr "QuaNThoR inicio rapido"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:3 769abf6ea4f84a3d89a9f26cb4ffd4b5
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:5 899f8f7b57ed42e38f726bb928b82fbd
msgid ""
"Use a clean checkout, the runtime declared by the repository, and its "
"committed lockfiles. Confirm the active branch before installing anything."
msgstr ""
"Use una copia limpia, el runtime declarado por el repositorio y sus archivos"
" de bloqueo confirmados. Confirme la rama activa antes de instalar nada."

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:11 9f8d729f9f214636acb5fc8c44db6281
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalar"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:17 c42f889cce164e27ac37a0aab93219f5
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Comenzar"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:24 5fc4604c3b0c40c0bac032b8b1c9d352
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:30 812cb3ac72fc4ae3b63f3c1b0a5f3181
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptacion humana"

#: ../../docs/tools/quanthor/quickstart.md:32 acfe16e0a8c6484aab441d4662478974
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione la salida, los registros, los resultados de pruebas y el diff. "
"Acepte, solicite una correccion, ponga en cuarentena o detengase; no "
"promueva silenciosamente un resultado generado."
